    "description": "Stylish 2BR/2BA Condo with Amazing City Views, Roof deck, Fantastic location! (199 New Montgomery St. #1302) - 13th Floor 2BR/2BA Condominium\n* $4,995/month annual lease\n* Washer/dryer * Views\n* Roof deck * 24-hour concierge\n* Parking for an add'l fee\n* Storage for an add'l fee\n* Small pet considered\n* Available: Now\n\nOPEN HOUSE: tbd\nLOCATION: 199 Montgomery # 1302\n\nContemporary 13th floor 2BR/2BA Condo with fantastic Amenities in a boutique style building right at the heart of San Francisco.\n\n       This apartment is newly renovated with an immense open floor plan.Panoramic windows in the living room will expose you to the best city views.\n\nFloor is new hardwood except in carpeted master bedroom and tile baths. Kitchen is equipped with Bosch stainless steel appliances include microwave, dishwasher, and electric stove.\n\nMaster bedroom has private bath. Both baths have shower-over-tub. Stacked washer/dryer are in the entry area wall closet.\n\nThis professionally managed building offers a huge roof deck  fantastic for rooftop picnics and  BBQ parties! \n\nDedicated parking space and secure storage room with its own door are available for an additional fee.\n\nWalkScore is 95.\n The best of San Francisco urban living is within reach  nearby famous restaurants as Tropisueno, Hakkasan and many others; Fitness centers as Equinox, Soul Cycle, 24 Hour Fitness are at your door step as well;\nWorld famous Union Square shopping and all the public transportation, including BART are all walking distance.\n\nEverest Mwamba\nKenney & Everest Real Estate\nBRE# 01984640\n(415) 929-0717 office\n(415) 377-2177 cell\nApply at everestmwamba . com\n\n(RLNE3590985)"
  },
